      "name": "Question 9",
      "problem": "The equation of the vertical line in the $xy$-plane that passes through the point $(7,4)$ is\n\n{{field-1}}\n$=$\n{{field-2}}",
      "worked_solution": "Since the vertical line should pass through $(7,4)$, the $x$-value for every point on the line is $7.$ Hence, the equation of that line is \n\n$$\nx=7.\n$$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14166027/assets/0f3e14c92e8e31beb12a2e33aa06fa1b9d349fab4688c39a45d4039859f18271.png)",
